# Satoko 1 enters hypermode and places one trap of each kind, far from the idle enemies.
# Run with --debug-keys f2@0,f4@150 so the gauge is full at the chord. Commands are blocked until
# about tick 180, so the chord waits for tick 200.
# Holding Shoot 20 ticks then releasing: forward (z=-1) row 451, neutral 450, sideways 452; in the
# air 460. Friendship (--special-mode 1) places the tagged bullets 1, 3, 5; Oyashiro (0) places 0, 2, 4.
0 200 203 melee shoot
0 300 345 z=-1
0 310 340 shoot
0 400 430 shoot
0 500 545 x=1
0 510 540 shoot
0 620 650 jump
0 625 660 shoot
0 720 724 shoot
